BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Likkle Bit
DTSTART:20260628T220000
DTEND:20260628T220000
UID:70169688db0c1cac18c501f0ee57b400@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Celebrating five years of sold-out success\, this BIPOC LGBTQI
 A+ showcase returns on June 28th\, bringing a vital safe space directly to
  the Heart of the Village. Designed as a dedicated sanctuary during Pride 
 weekend\, the event focuses on centering queer people of color in an envir
 onment built for authentic celebration and joy. Attendees can look forward
  to a high-energy atmosphere that honors community roots while providing a
  premium festive experience. It’s a staple event where safety meets cele
 bration\, ensuring the community has a place to truly call their own durin
 g the city’s busiest weekend. Queer Pride 2026 June 5 – 28\, 2026 WE
 ’RE BACK DIVAS &lt\;3 It’s Queer Pride 2026 and Buddies and Buddies Ni
 ghtlife are teaming up to make HERstory with our messiest\, most maximalis
 t Pride yet. We’ve got a full month line-up of extremely queer parties\,
  raves\, cabarets\, concerts\, and comedy. No matter what flavour you brin
 g\, there’s room for you in our alphabet soup \;) Join us on the biggest
  dance floor in the village for the best of queer culture in Toronto and b
 eyond. Thank you to our Government Partner\, Canadian Heritage\, and our G
 old Sponsor\, Freddie\, for making the 2026 Queer Pride Festival possible!
  ‍
LOCATION:Buddies in Bad Times\, 12 Alexander St
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/likkle-bit-3
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
