BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:SUPERSEXE - ARCADE!
DTSTART:20260705T220000
DTEND:20260705T220000
UID:1a659b579fc2b5a689708b4449abe149@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:We&#x27\;re levelling up for the Arcade edition of Supersexe o
 n July 5th! Come indulge in the one-of-a-kind silliness\, and deliciously 
 Pure Campy fashion at the 28th installment of Stella Maise&#x27\;s solo co
 llective show\; SUPERSEXE. Doors open at 10:00pm \; doors close at 1:30am 
 $20 at the door 10pm-1am\, $5 after 1am! Events ends at 2:30am. SUPERSEXE 
 LINEUP Stella Maise (@estellamaise on IG) WITH SPECIAL GUEST DJs XEON AEON
  (@xeonaeons on IG) STACXION (@stacxion on IG) Location: SeeScape\, 347 Ke
 ele St. T.O (This venue is unfortunately inaccessible\, no entry ramp avai
 lable. The show will be taking place in the upstairs area which is only ac
 cessible by stairs. Apologies for any limitations caused\; we look forward
  to our future events that are within fully accessible venues!) Theme: ARC
 ADE (Video games\, cyber space- bring on the cosplays and serves!) Music V
 ibe: Music vibes will be DnB\, Dubstep\, Hardcore\, Jungle\, Riddim\, Tech
 no\, Bass and beyond. An eclectic compilation of delicious cult hits and d
 eep cuts. Important: This is not an adult play/kink/s3x party. Supersexe i
 s an event for queer/trans/femme presenting people. If you do not fall und
 er this bracket\, you must be accompanied by someone who does. NO REFUNDS 
 Behind SUPERSEXE: A queer-led event\, spotlighting alternative artists and
  performers. SUPERSEXE is named after the now-closed Montreal-based strip 
 club\, Super Sexe\, that unfortunately burnt down in 2021. I (Stella) had 
 always wanted to go since I was a kid. The glitzy exterior\, the beautiful
  femme style\, the extravagance. I wanted to encapsulate the image in my h
 ead of what could&#x27\;ve been through this series (yes\, series!) of SUP
 ERSEXE. ‍
LOCATION:See-Scape\, 347 Keele St
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/supersexe---arcade
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
