BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:RATSKIN FAMILY BAND + FREDY CLUE AT DROM TABERNA
DTSTART:20260709T190000
DTEND:20260709T190000
UID:545fd97449628488d7fa84f80e4d6f00@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:QUEER FOLK MUSIC OF THE WORLD! Cross Dressing Country Music &a
 mp\; a touch of nyckelharpa ANOTHER SPECIAL NIGHT AT DROM! For this one we
 &#x27\;re thrilled to announce that we paired up a touring angel Fredy Clu
 e to open and even maybe play a few songs with the fam from Ratskin! FREDY
  CLUE Blending Nordic folk traditions with original songs\, storytelling\,
  laughter and queer magic\, Fredy takes audiences on a journey through lov
 e\, longing\, transformation and belonging. Armed with Sweden’s national
  instrument\, the nyckelharpa\, they invite everyone into a world where ev
 ery story deserves to be sung. “Fredy really is a creator of remarkable 
 experiences\, a true innovator in the folk art space.” — WJ Quinn RATS
 KIN FAMILY BAND This glamorous group of critters plays country standards\,
  reimagined pop hits and original country songs with Queer themes. In this
  band you will find familiar faces to Toronto’s drag scene as well as ne
 w performers. Join Amanda Prior\, Kitty Creature\, Tago Mago\, Zephline\, 
 Terry Dickoff and Candice Bich-Reed for a drag show like no other and a co
 ncert the likes of which can’t be found anywhere else on this planet! 
 ‍
LOCATION:DROM Taberna\, 458 Queen Street West
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/ratskin-family-band-fredy-clue-at-drom-tab
 erna
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
