DESCRIPTION:🚨🌈PRIDE MONTH ALERT!🌈🚨 The event we’ve all been 
 waiting for - T4BEACH\, Toronto’s first ALL Trans Beach Day! Calling all
  Transfemmes\, Transmascs &amp\; everyone in between + beyond for a gorgeo
 us day in nature\, surrounded by community. Allies welcome! 🏳️‍⚧
 ️ When: July 18th 11AM - Sunset / July 19th Rain Date Where: Hanlan’s 
 Point Clothing Optional Beach We have generously been given 150 free ferry
  tickets by the @waterfrontbia to give out to the first batch of folks who
  show up! First come\, first serve. We’ll have team members waiting by t
 he side of the ferry ticket booths\, handing them out starting 10:30AM - 1
 2:30PM or until all tickets have been claimed. These tickets are reserved 
 for members of the Trans community only. We’ll be going all day until su
 nset so be sure to stay aware of ferry &amp\; water taxi departure times. 
 Last ferry from Hanlan’s Point leaves at 11:00PM. You can find ferry sch
 edules on the city of Toronto website. A reminder that Hanlan’s Point Be
 ach is both a public &amp\; clothing optional space. You will be in the pr
 esence of N*dists/Naturists of all walks of life &amp\; we ask that you be
  respectful of that. As this is a public beach\, we cannot be in control o
 f who enters the space so please be aware of your surroundings &amp\; stic
 k with your friends. We’ll be posting more info &amp\; details as time g
 oes on so make sure you follow our instagram page to stay up to date! ‍ 
 ‍
