BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Queer Cinema Club Presents: Chocolate Babies
DTSTART:20260722T193000
DTEND:20260722T193000
UID:cd16d9236583a579c97bad1fe229abba@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Do you want to be part of the revolution? Well then @stephenwi
 ntersir’s staggering 1996 film CHOCOLATE BABIES is absolutely required v
 iewing. And we are offering an opportunity to see it in the best way possi
 ble: in a cinema full of queers but more importantly also with the film’
 s director Stephen Winter there *in person*!! Winter will sit down with QC
 C host @peterknegt after the film for a Q&amp\;A. Following a group of act
 ivists and artists (or as the movie describes them “raging\, atheist\, m
 eat-eating\, HIV-positive\, coloured terrorists”) who band together to s
 tage a series of surprise attacks on New York City’s conservative offici
 als\, CHOCOLATE BABIES feels just as relevant now as it did 30 years old. 
 Bold\, galvanizing and very much hilarious\, Winter made one of the great 
 cinematic responses to the AIDS crisis\, and one that still has so much to
  offer in terms of showing us what radical resistance looks like. So on Ju
 ly 22nd\, let’s take it all in and then sit down with the man who create
 d it to chat about what CHOCOLATE BABIES meant when it came out\, and what
  it means today. Tickets now available at @paradiseonbloor. Poster created
  by the mighty talents of @campjesss\, and will be available for purchase 
 at the screening. ‍
LOCATION:Paradise Theatre\, 1006 Bloor Street West
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/queer-cinema-club-presents-chocolate-babie
 s
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Femme Inferno 3.0: Ashes To Ashes
DTSTART:20260723T200000
DTEND:20260723T200000
UID:2f2eb11d2529e0d84ad63ebf4e9d98bf@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:A Queer Variety Show centered around feminine rage! This event
  is not Drag exclusive\, nor is it Queen or femme exclusive. Coming off of
  a highly rainbow-washed June\, this show is meant to be a palette cleanse
 r for audiences and performers! The concept for 3.0 is &quot\;ashes to ash
 es&quot\; and is all about the inherent ephemeral nature of life and the s
 ignificance of ritualistically returning to the Earth. Perhaps it even ref
 erences the transition of something grand or fabulous being reduced to not
 hing at all. Funneling this through feminie rage and Queer identity politi
 cs\, get ready to explore and bear witness to some of the darker sides of 
 pride\, representation\, visibility\, fabulousness\, and more! As Queer pe
 ople we know there are many difficult aspects of our identities to process
  and reconcile with even in our current society of seeming acceptance\, Pr
 ide\, and rainbow flags. Come on out and rage with us at Three Dollar Bill
  on July 23rd at 8pm! See ya there\, baddies! ‍
LOCATION:Three Dollar Bill\, 1592 Queen Street West
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/femme-inferno-3-0-ashes-to-ashes
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
